{"version":1,"content":"<p>前日本AV女優濱崎真緒早前懷疑被落藥須急送ICU搶救，近日她由日本返回香港時，又在航班上慘遇「機艙老鼠」，損失約值15萬元財物，嚇得她第一時間在社交平台向網民求救該如何是好，及後才主動報警求助！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;日</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:23:54.013390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:17:14.727086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:17:14.727086+00:00","content_hash":"6a71083d88e1d29aa871486021db07ca8b112f6e6027833fd76f40252db43c47","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}